{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39041","headline":"杨岐山 · 唐廪","name":"杨岐山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逗竹穿花越几村，还从旧路入云门。\n翠微不闭楼台出，清吹频回水石喧。\n天外鹤归松自老，岩间僧逝塔空存。\n重来白首良堪喜，朝露浮生不足言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐廪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39041.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39041","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}